{"path":"container/multimap/emplace","title":"std::multimap<Key,T,Compare,Allocator>::emplace","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::multimap&lt;Key,T,Compare,Allocator&gt;::</span>emplace","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/multimap/emplace","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts a new element into the container constructed in-place with the given args.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>iterator emplace<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts a new element into the container constructed in-place with the given <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">args</span></code>.\n</p><p>The constructor of the new element (i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair\"><span class=\"kw1104\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pair</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Key, T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>) is called with exactly the same arguments as supplied to <code>emplace</code>, forwarded via <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...</span></code>.\n</p><p>Careful use of <code>emplace</code> allows the new element to be constructed while avoiding unnecessary copy or move operations.\n</p><p>No iterators or references are invalidated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> args\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> arguments to forward to the constructor of the element\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An iterator to the inserted element.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>If an exception is thrown for any reason, this function has no effect (<a href=\"/w/cpp/language/exceptions#Exception_safety\">strong exception safety guarantee</a>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Logarithmic in the size of the container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;utility&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;map&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/multimap\"><span class=\"kw1293\">std::<span class=\"me2\">multimap</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> m<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// uses pair's move constructor</span>\n    m.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair/make_pair\"><span class=\"kw1105\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// uses pair's converting move constructor</span>\n    m.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair/make_pair\"><span class=\"kw1105\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"b\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"abcd\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// uses pair's template constructor</span>\n    m.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"d\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"ddd\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// emplace with duplicate key </span>\n    m.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"d\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"DDD\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// uses pair's piecewise constructor</span>\n    m.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/piecewise_construct\"><span class=\"kw1114\">std::<span class=\"me2\">piecewise_construct</span></span></a>,\n              <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/forward_as_tuple\"><span class=\"kw1122\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_as_tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"c\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n              <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/forward_as_tuple\"><span class=\"kw1122\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_as_tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'c'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> p <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> m<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">first</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" =&gt; \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">second</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>a =&gt; a\nb =&gt; abcd\nc =&gt; cccccccccc\nd =&gt; ddd\nd =&gt; DDD</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/multimap/emplace_hint\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>emplace_hint</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs elements in-place using a hint <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>try_emplace</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts in-place if the key does not exist, does nothing if the key exists <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/multimap/insert\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>insert</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts elements <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx17\"><span>or nodes</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></span></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/multimap","title":"std::multimap"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::multimap<Key,T,Compare,Allocator>::emplace","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Inserts a new element into the container constructed in-place with the given args."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"args"},{"label":"Return value","note":"An iterator to the inserted element."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If an exception is thrown for any reason, this function has no effect (strong exception safety guarantee)."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Logarithmic in the size of the container."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"emplace_hint","note":"constructs elements in-place using a hint"},{"label":"try_emplace","note":"inserts in-place if the key does not exist, does nothing if the key exists"},{"label":"insert","note":"inserts elements or nodes(since C++17)"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":243,"codeBlockCount":2}
